        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You conjure a swirling eddy of magical force, battering your targets and hindering their movement. Creatures in the area when you Cast the Spell or that start their turn there take 6d6 force damage with a basic Reflex save; on a failure, a creature also falls @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Prone]. The area is difficult terrain, and creatures attempting to Fly in the area must attempt an Acrobatics check against your spell DC; on a failure, the movement is disrupted, and any remaining movement from the action is wasted. In addition, unattended items of light Bulk or less are thrown around within the eddy and land in a random space in the area when the spell ends.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
